  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 505.01 Application Form, Where Available",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 505.01 Application Form, Where Available. The department shall furnish application forms for motor carrier registration at the division of motor vehicles, 23 Hazen Drive, Concord, N.H. 03305.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #8999, eff 9-29-07; ss by #10135, eff 5-23-12; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500)",
